+## Shell
+
+The `bash` tool needs a bash. PiG looks for Git for Windows at `%ProgramFiles%\Git\bin\bash.exe` and `%ProgramFiles(x86)%\Git\bin\bash.exe`, then for `bash.exe` on `PATH`. Set `shellPath` in `settings.json` to use another one. The `powershell` tool runs `pwsh.exe` when it is on `PATH`, and otherwise `powershell.exe`.
+
